	(text "Inter-MCU bus, mirrored for planar routing (U1 / U5 side by side, both rotated 180 deg):\nmaster GPIO(20+i) <-> slave GPIO(23-i).  Master pins unchanged.  Lane 1: D0-D7 = M20-27 / S23-16,\nCLK M28 / S15, VLD M29 / S14.  Lane 2: D0-D7 = M30-37 / S13-6, CLK M38 / S4, VLD M39 / S5,\nFS M40 / S3, DB_MS M41 / S2, DB_SM M42 / S1.  Data bits arrive reversed on the slave (PIO mov x, ::y).\nR7-R10 100R series on the master CLK / VLD pins.  RP2350A RUN (S_RUN): R1 pull-up,\nheld in reset by U11 P0 (Control sheet) via R35 1K."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 178 105 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b3661c1f-3da6-4890-ad32-073cbd2dbc79")
	)
